# CometWeb Agent Skills routing

Load skills from the installed skills directory. Prefer **one primary skill**
unless the user wants a multi-step workflow — then use `skill-orchestrator`
(`execution_mode`: auto | single_thread | isolated_subagents).

## Primary routing

| Intent | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| decision contract, deliberation, verdict GO/TEST/DEFER, living decisions | `ai-council` |
| EN/PL humanize, AI-tell removal, semantic-fidelity guards | `ai-humanize` |
| context snapshot, provenance, conflicts/gaps, ContextEnvelope, public claim gate | `cometweb-context` |
| competitor watchlist, delta digest, normalized competitor state | `competitive-intelligence` |
| support triage, incident candidate, eng handoff | `customer-ops` |
| partner cohort, learning contract, partnerability score | `design-partner-finder` |
| publication scope and coverage, publication claim ledger, editorial and design workflow, revision-bound publication QA | `ebook-publisher` |
| claim decomposition, evidence edges, falsifiers, Evidence Pack | `evidence-researcher` |
| weekly control loop, now/next/later/stop, roadmap drift | `product-operator` |
| external product patterns, ADOPT/ADAPT/AVOID | `product-teardown` |
| pinned RC gate, GO/NO_GO/DEFER, environment checks | `release-readiness` |
| whole-project baseline, gap inventory, immutable roadmap snapshot | `repo-to-roadmap` |
| SEO/GEO/AEO visibility audit, live-verified scoring | `seo-geo-aeo-maxxing` |
| multi-skill plan, execution_mode, CW-AIP handoffs, workflow result | `skill-orchestrator` |
| Alias for `skill-orchestrator` with isolated_subagents | `skill-orchestrator-multiagent` |
| live click-through QA, findings with evidence, audit report | `web-app-auditor` |

## Collision guardrails

- **ai-council** — does not own: Evidence Pack construction; context gateway; implementation. Explicit invocation only.
- **ai-humanize** — does not own: authorship claims; detector defeat; generic proofreading-only.
- **cometweb-context** — does not own: evidence packs; domain decisions; release gates; outbound copy.
- **competitive-intelligence** — does not own: strategic GO/NO_GO; pricing decision.
- **customer-ops** — does not own: release gate; Council decision.
- **design-partner-finder** — does not own: cold outbound copy; Council pricing.
- **ebook-publisher** — does not own: independent evidence truth certification; public publishing authorization; host installation; generic blog writing.
- **evidence-researcher** — does not own: final GO/NO_GO; release verdict; context-only refresh.
- **product-operator** — does not own: from-scratch roadmap; RC GO/NO_GO.
- **product-teardown** — does not own: owned-repo roadmap; release gate.
- **release-readiness** — does not own: weekly priorities; whole-project baseline.
- **repo-to-roadmap** — does not own: weekly sprint ops; RC ship gate.
- **seo-geo-aeo-maxxing** — does not own: Evidence Pack construction; click-through QA.
- **skill-orchestrator** — does not own: domain skill contracts; Council policy; release gates.
- **skill-orchestrator-multiagent** — does not own: separate planning model.
- **web-app-auditor** — does not own: release verdict; SEO scoring.

